        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Moogle_02:SubEv_C01_Moogle_02_008:03015cef",
        "jp_sha256": "e17b29b06206c7a99b8d00552e37c8ccbb3e4982d7298cc1df57874882d49dc2",
        "official_en_sha256": "c52777f786a5d50d6d49a543618da8cc11416a15eee18ff2caec8f6516f9652d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "こんなにビジョンを集められる人間を見たことがないクポ。\r\nそろそろキミタチを認めてあげてもいいクポ。",
        "official_en": "I’ve never seen a human collect this many visions, kupo. I <text style=\"italic”>guess</> I have to admit that you’re really something, kupo.",
        "real_en": "I've never seen a human collect this many Visions, kupo. I guess it's about time I gave you all some credit, kupo."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
